                                                "sense_id": "7a928faf-f875-3057-867f-ae6e2dde5b8e",
                                                "text": "Numerous variations of tiramisu exist. Some chefs use other cakes such as panettone. Although the original recipe – certified by the Italian Academy of Cuisine in 2010 – was alcohol-free, variants include alcohol such as rum or marsala."
                                            }
